{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19178","headline":"乐天见示伤微之敦诗晦叔三君子皆有深分因成是诗以寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天见示伤微之敦诗晦叔三君子皆有深分因成是诗以寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟君叹逝双绝句，使我伤怀奏短歌。\n世上空惊故人少，集中惟觉祭文多。\n芳林新叶催陈叶，流水前波让後波。\n万古到今同此恨，闻琴泪尽欲如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}